  "statuteText": "72:62 Exemption for Solar Energy Systems. –\n\nEach city and town may adopt under RSA 72:27-a an exemption from the assessed value, for property tax purposes, for persons owning real property which is equipped with a solar energy system as defined in RSA 72:61."
